{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/IMG_8820.gif?t=1741211253\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into <strong>03</strong>, a bullet-hell roguelike shooter set in a surreal universe inspired by the haunting art of H.R. Giger and Zdzis\u0142aw Beksi\u0144ski. As a lone astronaut stranded on a hostile planet, navigate ever-changing rooms filled with deadly traps and malevolent creatures. Uncover ancient ruins, confront intelligent life forms, and unravel the mysteries that lie within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/intro.gif?t=1741211253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/Explore_new.png?t=1741211253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The depths shift and reshape. Traverse ever-changing corridors, evade deadly traps, and fight to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/Explore.gif?t=1741211253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/fight_new.png?t=1741211253\" />The dungeon is relentless. Dash through waves of destruction, unleash devastating weapons, and carve a path through the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/Fight.gif?t=1741211253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/discover_new.png?t=1741211253\" />Uncover the unseen and step beyond the veil. Revea